/ja/booking       https://zonamb11111-bit.github.io/kommons-booking/  301
/ja/book-online   https://zonamb11111-bit.github.io/kommons-booking/  301

# Mood Curator (cross-domain → find subdomain)
/moodcurator      https://find.hairisyoursignature.jp/  301
/ja/moodcurator   https://find.hairisyoursignature.jp/  301

# llms.txt aliases
/llms-txt         /llms.txt  301
/ja/llms-txt      /llms.txt  301

# Japanese root — single-page LP auto-detects, but force lang=ja for explicit links
/ja               /?lang=ja  301

# Section anchors (FAQ etc.)
/faq              /#faq          301
/ja/faq           /?lang=ja#faq  301

# Apex (non-www) → www  (canonical preservation)
